event: answer
data: {"type":"answer","answer":{"summary":"Supported by the data: Sector-wide: the SIC 3711 industry (peers excluding Ford Motor) grew about as slowly as Ford Motor over the latest four fiscal years in the data. Refuted: Company-specific, Macro, Margin trade-off. Company figures cite each fiscal period end date (edgar fiscal_year = calendar year in which most of the fiscal year falls). Produced by Causa's deterministic sample analyst (SAMPLE_MODE: rule-based verdicts over real SEC EDGAR / World Bank rows, no LLM).","claims":[{"text":"Sector-wide: Ford Motor (F)'s SIC 3711 peers excluding F grew 12.77% (fiscal_year 2023), 6.15% (fiscal_year 2024), -1.85% (fiscal_year 2025) in aggregate, versus F's 11.47% (fiscal_year 2023), 5.00% (fiscal_year 2024), 1.23% (fiscal_year 2025), so the industry moved the same way [ev-2].","confidence":"high","evidenceIds":["ev-2"],"verified":true,"criticNote":"Critic: Sample critic (deterministic): 6 number(s) re-checked against the cited rows."},{"text":"Ford Motor (F) revenue went from $158.06B (FY ending 2022-12-31) to $187.27B (FY ending 2025-12-31), a 18.5% change; YoY growth was 11.47% (FY ending 2023-12-31), 5.00% (FY ending 2024-12-31), 1.23% (FY ending 2025-12-31) [ev-1].","confidence":"medium","evidenceIds":["ev-1"],"verified":true,"criticNote":"Critic: Sample critic (deterministic): 16 number(s) re-checked against the cited rows."},{"text":"Not company-specific: over fiscal_year 2023, 2024, 2025 Ford Motor (F)'s YoY growth (11.47% and 5.00% and 1.23%) was in line with its SIC 3711 peers: GM 9.64% and 9.08% and -1.29%; TSLA 18.80% and 0.95% and -2.93% [ev-1].","confidence":"medium","evidenceIds":["ev-1"],"verified":true,"criticNote":"Critic: Sample critic (deterministic): 9 number(s) re-checked against the cited rows."},{"text":"Not macro: US real private consumption grew 2.57% in 2023, 2.95% in 2024 while CPI inflation was 4.12% in 2023, 2.95% in 2024, so consumer demand was still expanding in real terms [ev-3].","confidence":"medium","evidenceIds":["ev-3"],"verified":true,"criticNote":"Critic: Sample critic (deterministic): 4 number(s) re-checked against the cited rows."},{"text":"Not a margin trade-off: Ford Motor (F)'s operating margin also fell, from 3.97% (FY ending 2022-12-31) to -4.90% (FY ending 2025-12-31) [ev-4].","confidence":"medium","evidenceIds":["ev-4"],"verified":true,"criticNote":"Critic: Sample critic (deterministic): 6 number(s) re-checked against the cited rows."}],"models":["causa/sample-analyst"]}}
